   Ledesma, Gabriela; Pons-Valladares, Oriol, Univ Politecn Cataluna, Sch Architecture ETSAB, Dept Architectural Technol, UPC Polytech Univ Catalonia,Barcelona Tech, Ave Diagonal 649, Barcelona 08028, Spain.
   Nikolic, Jelena, Univ Politecn Cataluna, Dept Phys, Sch Architecture ETSAB, UPC Polytech Univ Catalonia,Barcelona Tech, Ave Diagonal 649, Barcelona 08028, Spain.},
DOI = {10.1016/j.jclepro.2020.122993},
